SystemUI: DozeSensors: listen to non-one-shot wake-up gesture sensors

Apply in frameworks/base of a GSI source tree (git apply). Applies cleanly to
LineageOS lineage-23.2; built and tested on a PixelOS 16 GSI on vegas26.

requestTriggerSensor() only accepts REPORTING_MODE_ONE_SHOT sensors, so a
doze double-tap sensor that the vendor HAL exposes as a special-trigger
wake-up sensor (Motorola "dt-gesture", com.motorola.sensor.double_tap) was
never registered and double tap to wake did nothing. Register such sensors
with a plain SensorEventListener and handle their events exactly like a
trigger, without dropping the registration after each event.

